मण्डलम् घोषणासञ्चय ॥   ॰ THE SHARED DECLARATION STORE (W-223 part 1, 2026-09-04)

॰ ॥ What this is ॥
॰
॰ Every `.t1` source's declarations, in ONE store keyed by module, so that a
॰ qualified use `मण्डलॱनाम` and a qualified type position can be looked up
॰ against the MEMBER the module declares and not only against the import.
॰ W-223's audit (sansos-30, 2026-09-04) found all three of its premises false:
॰ there is no export table, `व्याकर` holds the ONE source it parsed, and the
॰ harness parses one file at a time. This module is the space those premises
॰ assumed. It copies — `सङ्ग्रहः` reads `व्याकर`'s arenas after a parse and
॰ writes every name and type AS TEXT into arenas of its own, because the
॰ token arena is reset by the next `पदविभाग` and an index into it would dangle.
॰
॰ Twin: `nirvahana.rs`'s loader tables (`Interpreter::declarations`, W-224's
॰ order-independent load), pinned in `t1_sources.rs` as `STORE_SYMBOLS`; the
॰ census `measure_corpus_qualified_uses` (t1_paradigm_names.rs) asserts the two
॰ twins hold the same modules, names, kinds and types.
॰
॰ Kinds are `व्याकर`'s own: १ routine, २ type (संरचना), ३ machine, ४ global,
॰ ५ import, ६ enum — and one of this store's, ७ VARIANT: `गणनापठनम्` appends
॰ each variant to `घोषणाकोश` as a declaration of kind ४ right after its enum,
॰ and the enum's प्राचलादि..प्राचलान्त are DECLARATION indices, not प्राचल
॰ ones. Here a variant is an entry of kind ७ under its module (a qualified use
॰ `मण्डलॱरक्त` finds it) AND a member of its enum's run. A routine's
॰ parameters, a struct's fields and an enum's variants all live in
॰ `प्राचलप्रविष्टिकोश` (a variant's type is empty).
॰ Two files of one module (`वास्तु`: ast.t1 and vastu.t1, W-224) fall into one
॰ module entry, because a module is found by NAME before it is added.
॰
॰ Four helpers carry the prefix `सञ्चय` because उत्सर्जन, अष्टक, वाक्यविभाग and
॰ मुद्रण declare `पाठयोजनम्`, `अष्टकयोजनम्`, `पाठसाम्यम्` and `प्रकारलेखनम्` of
॰ their own, and `Interpreter::global` keys the bare name (t1_sources.rs's
॰ two-modules test); a module index is `मण्डलाङ्कः`, since `मण्डलम्` is the
॰ keyword.
॰
॰ REFUSED, by name: `सदस्यान्वेषणम्` answers ० and records the refusal — kind १
॰ the module is not in the store, kind २ the module is but declares no such
॰ member — so a census can say which of the two it was, at every site.

आयातः पदविभाग ।
आयातः वास्तु ।
आयातः व्याकर ।

॰ ॥ the records ॥

सार्वजनिक संरचना मण्डलप्रविष्टि आरभ्य
    नामारम्भः ॱॱ न६४ ऽ                      ॰ the module's name, a range of पाठकोश
    नामसीमा ॱॱ न६४ ऽ
    प्रविष्टिसंख्या ॱॱ न६४                   ॰ how many entries name this module
समाप्तम् ।

सार्वजनिक संरचना प्रविष्टि आरभ्य
    मण्डल ॱॱ न६४ ऽ                          ॰ index into मण्डलकोश
    भेद ॱॱ न६४ ऽ                            ॰ व्याकर's declaration kind
    नामारम्भः ॱॱ न६४ ऽ                      ॰ the declared name, a range of पाठकोश
    नामसीमा ॱॱ न६४ ऽ
